%[text]{"align":"center"} $f(t) = 0.5 - \\sin(4 \\pi t) + \\cos( 4 \\pi t)${"altText":"f(t) = 0.5 - \sin(4 \pi t) + \cos( 4 \pi t)"}
%[text] If correct, you should see the time series plotted below.
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![magPlot2](text:image:1b41)
